   "stem": {
      "text": "The table gives values of the differentiable functions u and v and their derivatives at selected values of x. Let \\( h(x) = u(v(x)) \\). The entry for \\( v'(3) \\) is missing, but \\( h'(3) = -6 \\). Find \\( v'(3) \\).",
