   },
   "answer_key": {
      "form": "symbolic",
      "mathjson": -3
   },
   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "By the chain rule, \\( h'(x) = u'(v(x)) \\cdot v'(x) \\). From the table, \\( v(3) = 4 \\), so the outer derivative is read in the row x = 4: \\( u'(4) = 2 \\).",
         "rule_named": "chain rule"
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "So \\( -6 = h'(3) = 2 \\cdot v'(3) \\), and \\( v'(3) = -3 \\).",
         "mathjson": -3,
         "rule_named": "solve for the missing factor"
      }
   ],
